winget install --id Git.Git -e --source winget
 
curl -o GitInstaller.exe https://github.com/git-for-windows/git/releases/latest/download/Git-64-bit.exe
 
then reopen your command prompt
 
and run git --version
 
git would be installed now
 
clone the project in your local and go that directory 
 
and run git checkout -b your-branch-name
 
then local branch would be created 
 
then run : git push -u origin your-branch-name
 